{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b01", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "hook", "delivery": "curious", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.3, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 19, "facts": 1}, "why": "Two cartoon colleagues by a meeting table; a speech bubble 'I felt dismissed' sits large, and the colleague's question mark hangs over their head with nothing to answer it.", "id": "eccf2e40c1b17101", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b02", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "orient", "delivery": "warm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.3, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 19, "facts": 1}, "why": "The same two colleagues; the vague bubble stays while three small labels, act on, next step, revisit, arrive on their words along a faint path.", "id": "087cabc739ff8ad1", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b03", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "refute", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.25, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 13, "facts": 1}, "why": "The 'I felt dismissed' bubble is highlighted; beside it an empty action slot stays blank, so the gap is visible while the feeling is kept, not crossed out.", "id": "8d82b33612606ab1", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b04", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "demonstrate", "delivery": "neutral", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.5, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 22, "facts": 3}, "why": "The vague bubble is revised in place: the line is replaced by the specific action in its update setting, then an effect line is added beneath it, with the active line highlighted and the rest dimmed.", "id": "71150b0cb30cbb5a", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b05", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec1", "job": "define", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.2, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 26, "facts": 3}, "why": "The two revised lines get small pill labels on them, observed behaviour and impact, each on its word; a character-label bubble drifts out of the frame. The colleagues are then shown alone, away from the table.", "id": "c2d6c2465a02566f", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b06", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "demonstrate", "delivery": "curious", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.5, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 27, "facts": 3}, "why": "The colleague's reply bubble appears beside the revised lines; the giver's interpretation line shifts to make room, showing the description being checked rather than defended.", "id": "9e08e166ef057b6d", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b07", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "demonstrate", "delivery": "neutral", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.45, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 27, "facts": 2}, "why": "A proposed action card, 'Finish the handover first', replaces the label bubble; a small check mark asks about the colleague's role, and a blocked path beside it is marked 'support' rather than a louder demand.", "id": "53432413d5e6b34c", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b08", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "define", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.25, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 22, "facts": 4}, "why": "The proposal card is held while a question mark is placed on it and the words 'action + situation' light up, with a 'not a label' strike through a crossed-out label bubble; this is the one emphasised moment.", "id": "f744a64659b854e4", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b09", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "check", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.2, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 18, "facts": 1}, "why": "Question card: the next status update setting with two unmarked wording cards, A and B, side by side. No correct marker.", "id": "6bce7ac720149494", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b10", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec2", "job": "check", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.25, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 22, "facts": 2}, "why": "Same two cards: B is highlighted and its action and situation parts are marked; A dims with a question mark over the colleague. A small note says 'a proposal to discuss'.", "id": "afeb88fdb177deb6", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b11", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec3", "job": "sequence", "delivery": "warm", "treatment_hint": "motion", "animate_score": 0.4, "change_over_time": true}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 27, "facts": 4}, "why": "Light diagram: the two colleagues agree, an arrow leads to a later update, where the agreed action is marked 'look for' with an empty box, not ticked.", "id": "fe8c7466ffc29e99", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
{"v": 1, "lesson": "bench-20261007-003835-smart-mix", "event": "decision", "node": "script:b12", "decision": "beat_design", "choice": {"section": "sec3", "job": "refute", "delivery": "calm", "treatment_hint": "template", "animate_score": 0.2, "change_over_time": false}, "by": {"kind": "agent", "tier": "plan", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "mode": "agent"}, "features": {"words": 16, "facts": 2}, "why": "The agreed handshake sits beside the later update where the 'look for' box stays empty; a second note sits over any future improvement. No success is animated.", "id": "c91ec3e2995958ae", "at": "2026-10-07T00:44:08"}
